.TH CUT_SAY_LINE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
CUT_SAY_LINE \- CutStep initializer: show a dialog line spoken by who (NULL for none) and wait until the player dismisses it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcutscene.h\(dq
.ft B
#define CUT_SAY_LINE(who, line) { .kind = CUT_SAY, .speaker = (who), .text = (line) }
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
CutStep initializer: show a dialog line spoken by who (NULL for none) and wait until the player dismisses it.
.SH MODULE
cutscene (src/engine/cutscene/cutscene.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR CutStep (3),
.BR dialog_show (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
